01:21:08.050 --> 01:21:09.067
And Joey was just like,

01:21:09.067 --> 01:21:10.690
"Yeah."
- Yeah.

01:21:10.690 --> 01:21:12.460
- And I was just thinking to myself,

01:21:12.460 --> 01:21:13.810
why would he lie like that?

01:21:15.150 --> 01:21:16.390
- The heroes of anime.

01:21:16.390 --> 01:21:18.020
I was just like doing the blinking meme,

01:21:18.020 --> 01:21:18.893
I was like, what?

01:21:20.090 --> 01:21:23.240
- To be fair though, I
would say it's kinda true.

01:21:23.240 --> 01:21:25.523
Like there's a lot of people that-

01:21:26.450 --> 01:21:29.317
- There's a lot of people
who would disagree with that.

01:21:29.317 --> 01:21:31.401
