01:27:16.490 --> 01:27:19.930
the best aspect was just
chatting to the other creators.

01:27:19.930 --> 01:27:21.000
- It felt like a holiday,

01:27:21.000 --> 01:27:22.956
where you just got to meet other creators.

01:27:22.956 --> 01:27:25.427
- I got to eat Chipotle, I've
been missing Chipotle a lot.

01:27:27.225 --> 01:27:29.210
I was like, 'cause we would
all eat lunch together,

01:27:29.210 --> 01:27:31.697
and I was like, "Chipotle,
I want Chipotle,"

01:27:31.697 --> 01:27:35.840
