- I think out of every cuisine

01:27:51.900 --> 01:27:54.620
Mexican is one of the
hardest to find in Japan.

01:27:54.620 --> 01:27:56.370
- I want a burrito that
like fucking kills me.

01:27:56.370 --> 01:27:58.295
So anyway, it was nice
having lunch with them.

01:27:58.295 --> 01:28:00.115
Sorry, I'm going on a rant there.

01:28:00.115 --> 01:28:01.930
But yeah, it was pretty
cool, the offices were cool,

01:28:01.930 --> 01:28:02.967
they've made it into like-

01:28:02.967 --> 01:28:05.140
