the offices, didn't they?

01:28:05.140 --> 01:28:05.973
- Yeah, it was cool.

01:28:05.973 --> 01:28:08.802
I mean, I felt like a little
extra, like, I don't know,

01:28:08.802 --> 01:28:10.370
there was a lot of free LaCroix,

01:28:10.370 --> 01:28:11.880
I didn't really care for LaCroix.

